  was inspected during development (accession 0001045810-23-000242).

  Exercises: documentType "4/A" so is_amendment derives True, and
  <dateOfOriginalSubmission>, which real Form 4s do not carry at all; it appears only on
  amendments. Nothing here says which accession this amends, because the document does not
  say, and the parser must not guess.

  See tests/fixtures/sec/README.md.
-->
